From: Codex <codex@openai.com>
Subject: [PATCH] metrics: update only the controller's current STA rows

STA metrics are measurements for an association; they are not association
state transitions.  The controller's metrics persistence path nevertheless
called the general STA set_config() for every row in each Agent data model.
set_config() inserts a missing key and enforces single ownership, so an old
Agent retaining a silent roam-away could reinsert its stale row and evict the
destination Agent's current association every reporting interval.

Before persisting metrics, resolve the exact STA/BSSID/radio key in the
controller-owned list.  Update it only when that current row exists and is
associated.  A stale Agent-local row is skipped and cannot mutate topology;
Client Association Events remain the only owner-changing input.

Upstream-Status: Pending
---
 src/ctrl/dm_easy_mesh_ctrl.cpp | 17 +++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 17 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/ctrl/dm_easy_mesh_ctrl.cpp b/src/ctrl/dm_easy_mesh_ctrl.cpp
--- a/src/ctrl/dm_easy_mesh_ctrl.cpp
+++ b/src/ctrl/dm_easy_mesh_ctrl.cpp
@@ -4335,8 +4335,25 @@ int dm_easy_mesh_ctrl_t::update_tables(dm_easy_mesh_t *dm)
 
     if (dm->db_cfg_type_is_set(db_cfg_type_sta_metrics_update)) {
         sta = static_cast<dm_sta_t *> (hash_map_get_first(dm->m_sta_map));
         while (sta != NULL) {
+            dm_sta_t *current_sta;
+            dm_easy_mesh_t::macbytes_to_string(sta->m_sta_info.id,
+                    sta_mac_str);
+            dm_easy_mesh_t::macbytes_to_string(sta->m_sta_info.bssid,
+                    bssid_str);
+            dm_easy_mesh_t::macbytes_to_string(sta->m_sta_info.radiomac,
+                    radio_mac_str);
+            snprintf(key, sizeof(em_2xlong_string_t), "%s@%s@%s",
+                    sta_mac_str, bssid_str, radio_mac_str);
+            current_sta = get_sta(key);
+            if (current_sta == NULL ||
+                    current_sta->m_sta_info.associated == false) {
+                em_printfout("Skipping metrics for non-current STA row %s", key);
+                sta = static_cast<dm_sta_t *>(
+                        hash_map_get_next(dm->m_sta_map, sta));
+                continue;
+            }
 			criteria = dm->db_cfg_type_get_criteria(db_cfg_type_sta_metrics_update);
             if (dm_sta_list_t::set_config(m_db_client, *sta, NULL) == 0) {
                 dm->reset_db_cfg_type(db_cfg_type_sta_metrics_update);
             }
